{
  "id": 395838646,
  "iid": 20428,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "file: Work around DSBs not at the start of a file",
  "description": "If we encounter a DSB not at the start of a file when reading it,\nmark the file as having unsaved changes. After all, if we save the\nfile, we'll move the DSBs to the beginning.\n\nAlso, trigger a redissection after we're done. A DSB in the middle\nmight have come slightly too later for packets, and it might change\ndissection. (Should this be under a pref?)\n\nFor live capture mark the unsaved changes but do not queue redissection yet, which might also work but\nneeds more testing.\n\nFix #20558",
  "state": "merged",
